{%- comment -%}
  Sekcja opinii.

  Srednia, liczba i rozklad ocen sa LICZONE z blokow, ktore wpiszesz -
  nie wpisuje sie ich osobno. Dzieki temu gwiazdki przy tytule produktu
  nigdy nie pokaza czegos innego niz opinie pod spodem.

  Rozklad ocen (slupki 5-1) jest tu celowo: w badaniach Baymarda to
  najczesciej uzywany element sekcji opinii - czesciej niz same tresci -
  a jego brak sprawia, ze ludzie uznaja opinie za podstawione.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign opinie = section.blocks | where: 'type', 'review'
  assign ile = opinie.size

  assign suma = 0
  assign n5 = 0
  assign n4 = 0
  assign n3 = 0
  assign n2 = 0
  assign n1 = 0

  for b in opinie
    assign ocena = b.settings.rating | plus: 0
    assign suma = suma | plus: ocena
    case ocena
      when 5
        assign n5 = n5 | plus: 1
      when 4
        assign n4 = n4 | plus: 1
      when 3
        assign n3 = n3 | plus: 1
      when 2
        assign n2 = n2 | plus: 1
      else
        assign n1 = n1 | plus: 1
    endcase
  endfor

  assign srednia = 0
  if ile > 0
    assign srednia = suma | times: 10.0 | divided_by: ile | round | divided_by: 10.0
  endif
  assign pelnych = srednia | round
-%}

{%- style -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr {
    --obr-text: {{ section.settings.color_text }};
    --obr-muted: {{ section.settings.color_muted }};
    --obr-line: {{ section.settings.color_line }};
    --obr-star: {{ section.settings.color_star }};
    --obr-off: {{ section.settings.color_star_off }};
    --obr-bar: {{ section.settings.color_bar }};
    background: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
    color: var(--obr-text);
    padding: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px 0 {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  {%- comment -%}
    Uklad jak na Trustpilocie: werdykt slowem, piec zielonych kafelkow
    z gwiazdka, pod spodem jedna linia z ocena i liczba opinii.
    Karty w dwoch kolumnach, obwiedzione wlosowa kreska, bez cienia.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__head { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__verdict {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
    margin: 0 0 7px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__verdict-word {
    font-size: {{ section.settings.title_size }}px; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__rated {
    margin: 0; font-size: 14.5px; color: var(--obr-muted);
  }

  /* ---------- kafelki z gwiazdkami ---------- */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__tiles { display: inline-flex; gap: 2px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__tile {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    width: 20px; height: 20px;
    background: var(--obr-off);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__tile.is-on { background: var(--obr-star); }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__tile svg { width: 13px; height: 13px; color: #fff; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__tiles--sm .obr__tile { width: 17px; height: 17px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__tiles--sm .obr__tile svg { width: 11px; height: 11px; }

  /* ---------- rozklad ocen ---------- */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__bars {
    display: grid; gap: 6px;
    max-width: 380px; margin: 0 0 22px;
    font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--obr-muted);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__bar {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 76px minmax(0, 1fr) 34px;
    gap: 10px; align-items: center;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__bar-track {
    height: 7px; background: var(--obr-line); display: block;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__bar-fill {
    height: 100%; background: var(--obr-bar); display: block;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__bar-num { text-align: right; }

  /* ---------- karty ---------- */
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat({{ section.settings.columns }}, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 16px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card {
    border: 1px solid var(--obr-line);
    background: #fff;
    padding: 18px 20px 20px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card-top {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card-where {
    font-size: 12px; color: var(--obr-muted); white-space: nowrap;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card-sep { margin: 0 5px; opacity: 0.6; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card-who {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; flex-wrap: wrap;
    font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__verified {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 3px;
    font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--obr-muted);
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__verified svg { width: 12px; height: 12px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card-title {
    font-size: 15.5px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 7px;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card-text {
    font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--obr-muted);
  }

  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__empty {
    border: 1px dashed var(--obr-line);
    padding: 26px; text-align: center;
    font-size: 14px; color: var(--obr-muted);
  }

  @media only screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr {
      padding: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px 0 {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__verdict-word { font-size: 18px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card { padding: 15px 16px 17px; }
  }

  {%- comment -%}
    PC: najpierw N opinii, reszta pod przyciskiem "Vis flere anmeldelser".
    Telefon: poziomy rzad przesuwany palcem (karta 86 % szerokosci, wiec
    widac skraj nastepnej), pod spodem strzalki 44 px i licznik 1 / 12.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__more { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-top: 26px; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__more[hidden] { display: none; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__more-btn {
    min-height: 48px; padding: 0 30px; cursor: pointer;
    border: 1px solid var(--obr-text); background: transparent; color: var(--obr-text);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: background-color 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
  }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__more-btn:hover { background: var(--obr-text); color: #ffffff; }
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__nav { display: none; }
  @media only screen and (min-width: 769px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card--wiecej:not(.is-pokazana) { display: none; }
  }
  @media only screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__list {
      display: flex; gap: 12px;
      overflow-x: auto; scroll-snap-type: x mandatory; scroll-padding-left: 17px;
      margin: 0 -17px; padding: 0 17px 4px;
      scrollbar-width: none; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__list::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__card { flex: 0 0 86%; scroll-snap-align: start; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__more { display: none; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__nav { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 18px; margin-top: 14px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__nav-btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      width: 44px; height: 44px; padding: 0; cursor: pointer;
      border: 1px solid var(--obr-line); background: #ffffff; color: var(--obr-text);
    }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__nav-btn svg { width: 9px; height: 15px; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__nav-btn[disabled] { opacity: 0.35; cursor: default; }
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} .obr__nav-count { min-width: 56px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: var(--obr-muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  }
{%- endstyle -%}

{%- capture gwiazdka_pelna -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 1l2.39 4.84 5.35.78-3.87 3.77.91 5.32L10 13.27l-4.78 2.44.91-5.32L2.26 6.62l5.35-.78z"/></svg>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture gwiazdka_pusta -%}
  <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M10 1l2.39 4.84 5.35.78-3.87 3.77.91 5.32L10 13.27l-4.78 2.44.91-5.32L2.26 6.62l5.35-.78z"/></svg>
{%- endcapture -%}

<div class="obr" id="{{ section.settings.anchor | default: 'anmeldelser' | handleize }}">
  <div class="page-width">

    {%- if ile > 0 -%}
      {%- liquid
        assign werdykt = section.settings.verdict_low
        if srednia >= 3.5
          assign werdykt = section.settings.verdict_mid
        endif
        if srednia >= 4.3
          assign werdykt = section.settings.verdict_high
        endif
      -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Liczby zapisane w atrybutach - stad bierze je sekcja produktu,
        zeby ocena nad tytulem pokazywala dokladnie to samo.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="obr__head" data-obr-agg data-obr-avg="{{ srednia }}" data-obr-count="{{ ile }}">
        <div class="obr__verdict">
          <span class="obr__verdict-word">{{ werdykt }}</span>
          <span class="obr__tiles">
            {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
              <span class="obr__tile{% if forloop.index <= pelnych %} is-on{% endif %}">{{ gwiazdka_pelna }}</span>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </span>
        </div>
        <p class="obr__rated">
          {{ section.settings.rated_label }} {{ srednia }} / 5 {{ section.settings.based_label }} {{ ile }} {{ section.settings.reviews_word }}
        </p>
      </div>

      {%- if section.settings.show_distribution -%}
        <div class="obr__bars">
          {%- assign licznosci = n5 | append: ',' | append: n4 | append: ',' | append: n3 | append: ',' | append: n2 | append: ',' | append: n1 | split: ',' -%}
          {%- for licz in licznosci -%}
            {%- liquid
              assign gwiazd = 5 | minus: forloop.index0
              assign n = licz | plus: 0
              assign procent = 0
              if ile > 0
                assign procent = n | times: 100 | divided_by: ile
              endif
            -%}
            <div class="obr__bar">
              <span>{{ gwiazd }} {{ section.settings.star_word }}</span>
              <span class="obr__bar-track"><span class="obr__bar-fill" style="width: {{ procent }}%;"></span></span>
              <span class="obr__bar-num">{{ n }}</span>
            </div>
          {%- endfor -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- assign na_start = section.settings.desktop_initial | default: 3 -%}
      <div class="obr__list" data-obr-list aria-label="{{ section.settings.reviews_word | capitalize }}">
        {%- for block in opinie -%}
          {%- assign oc = block.settings.rating | plus: 0 -%}
          <div class="obr__card{% if forloop.index > na_start %} obr__card--wiecej{% endif %}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
            <div class="obr__card-top">
              <span class="obr__tiles obr__tiles--sm">
                {%- for i in (1..5) -%}
                  <span class="obr__tile{% if forloop.index <= oc %} is-on{% endif %}">{{ gwiazdka_pelna }}</span>
                {%- endfor -%}
              </span>
              {%- if block.settings.country != blank or block.settings.date != blank -%}
                <span class="obr__card-where">
                  {%- if block.settings.country != blank -%}{{ block.settings.country }}{%- endif -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.country != blank and block.settings.date != blank -%}
                    <span class="obr__card-sep">&ndash;</span>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  {%- if block.settings.date != blank -%}{{ block.settings.date }}{%- endif -%}
                </span>
              {%- endif -%}
            </div>

            {%- if block.settings.author != blank or block.settings.verified -%}
              <div class="obr__card-who">
                {%- if block.settings.author != blank -%}<span>{{ block.settings.author }}</span>{%- endif -%}
                {%- if block.settings.verified -%}
                  <span class="obr__verified">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m5 12 5 5L19 7"/></svg>
                    {{ section.settings.verified_label }}
                  </span>
                {%- endif -%}
              </div>
            {%- endif -%}

            {%- if block.settings.title != blank -%}
              <div class="obr__card-title">{{ block.settings.title }}</div>
            {%- endif -%}
            {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
              <div class="obr__card-text">{{ block.settings.text }}</div>
            {%- endif -%}
          </div>
        {%- endfor -%}
      </div>

      {%- assign reszta = ile | minus: na_start -%}
      {%- if reszta > 0 and section.settings.more_label != blank -%}
        <div class="obr__more">
          <button type="button" class="obr__more-btn" data-obr-more>{{ section.settings.more_label }} (<span data-obr-ile>{{ reszta }}</span>)</button>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
      {%- if ile > 1 -%}
        <div class="obr__nav">
          <button type="button" class="obr__nav-btn" data-obr-prev aria-label="Forrige anmeldelse">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 8 14" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7 1 1 7l6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
          </button>
          <span class="obr__nav-count"><span data-obr-nr>1</span> / {{ ile }}</span>
          <button type="button" class="obr__nav-btn" data-obr-next aria-label="Næste anmeldelse">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 8 14" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="m1 1 6 6-6 6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}

      <script>
        (function () {
          var root = document.getElementById('shopify-section-{{ section.id }}');
          var lista = root && root.querySelector('[data-obr-list]');
          if (!lista) return;
          var KROK = {{ na_start }};

          // PC: "Vis flere anmeldelser" - kolejne opinie partiami
          var btn = root.querySelector('[data-obr-more]');
          function ukryte() { return lista.querySelectorAll('.obr__card--wiecej:not(.is-pokazana)'); }
          function przycisk() {
            if (!btn) return;
            var n = ukryte().length;
            if (!n) { btn.parentNode.hidden = true; return; }
            var licz = btn.querySelector('[data-obr-ile]');
            if (licz) licz.textContent = n;
          }
          if (btn) btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
            var h = ukryte(), pierwsza = null;
            for (var i = 0; i < h.length && i < KROK; i++) {
              h[i].classList.add('is-pokazana');
              if (!pierwsza) pierwsza = h[i];
            }
            // klawiatura: fokus na pierwsza nowa opinie, zeby nie zgubic miejsca
            if (pierwsza) { pierwsza.setAttribute('tabindex', '-1'); pierwsza.focus({ preventScroll: true }); }
            przycisk();
          });
          przycisk();

          // telefon: rzad bez konca. Przed i za oryginalami stoja kopie (ukryte
          // przed czytnikami i klawiatura). Gdy rzad stanie na kopii, pozycja
          // przeskakuje niezauwazalnie na ten sam oryginal - kopie sa identyczne,
          // wiec przewijanie za ostatnia opinia plynnie przechodzi w pierwsza.
          var oryg = [].slice.call(lista.querySelectorAll('.obr__card'));
          var N = oryg.length;
          var nr = root.querySelector('[data-obr-nr]');
          var prev = root.querySelector('[data-obr-prev]');
          var next = root.querySelector('[data-obr-next]');
          var mq = window.matchMedia('(max-width: 768px)');
          function szer() {
            var gap = parseFloat(getComputedStyle(lista).columnGap) || 12;
            return oryg[0].getBoundingClientRect().width + gap;
          }
          function pozycja() { return Math.round(lista.scrollLeft / szer()); }
          function zbuduj() {
            if (lista.dataset.petla || N < 2) return;
            var przed = document.createDocumentFragment(), za = document.createDocumentFragment();
            oryg.forEach(function (karta) {
              [przed, za].forEach(function (cel) {
                var c = karta.cloneNode(true);
                c.classList.add('obr__card--klon');
                c.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');
                c.setAttribute('inert', '');
                c.removeAttribute('tabindex');
                c.removeAttribute('data-shopify-editor-block');
                cel.appendChild(c);
              });
            });
            lista.insertBefore(przed, lista.firstChild);
            lista.appendChild(za);
            lista.dataset.petla = '1';
            lista.scrollLeft = N * szer();
          }
          function rozbierz() {
            [].slice.call(lista.querySelectorAll('.obr__card--klon')).forEach(function (c) { c.remove(); });
            delete lista.dataset.petla;
            lista.scrollLeft = 0;
          }
          function wyrownaj() {
            if (!lista.dataset.petla) return;
            var i = pozycja();
            if (i < N) lista.scrollLeft += N * szer();
            else if (i >= 2 * N) lista.scrollLeft -= N * szer();
          }
          // cel animacji strzalki: do jego osiagniecia nie wyrownujemy, bo
          // przeskok w trakcie plynnego przewijania zbijal je z kursu
          var cel = null;
          function stan() {
            if (cel !== null) {
              if (Math.abs(lista.scrollLeft - cel) > 2) return;
              cel = null;
            }
            wyrownaj();
            var i = lista.dataset.petla ? ((pozycja() - N) % N + N) % N : pozycja();
            if (nr) nr.textContent = Math.min(N, i + 1);
          }
          function idz(o) {
            wyrownaj();
            cel = (pozycja() + o) * szer();
            lista.scrollTo({ left: cel, behavior: 'smooth' });
            // zabezpieczenie, gdyby animacja nie doszla dokladnie do celu
            clearTimeout(idz.t);
            idz.t = setTimeout(function () { cel = null; stan(); }, 1200);
          }
          if (prev) prev.addEventListener('click', function () { idz(-1); });
          if (next) next.addEventListener('click', function () { idz(1); });
          var czekaj;
          lista.addEventListener('scroll', function () { clearTimeout(czekaj); czekaj = setTimeout(stan, 120); }, { passive: true });
          lista.addEventListener('scrollend', function () { clearTimeout(czekaj); cel = null; stan(); });
          // dotyk przerywa animacje strzalki - wtedy cel juz nie obowiazuje
          lista.addEventListener('pointerdown', function () { cel = null; }, { passive: true });
          lista.addEventListener('touchstart', function () { cel = null; }, { passive: true });
          function tryb() { if (mq.matches) zbuduj(); else rozbierz(); stan(); }
          if (mq.addEventListener) mq.addEventListener('change', tryb); else if (mq.addListener) mq.addListener(tryb);
          tryb();
        })();
      </script>
{%- else -%}
      <div class="obr__empty">{{ section.settings.empty_text }}</div>
    {%- endif -%}

  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Reviews",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "The score, the count and the bars are all worked out from the reviews you add below. You never type the average yourself, so it cannot drift away from what is on the page." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Small heading above", "default": "ANMELDELSER" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Heading", "default": "Det siger vores kunder" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "anchor", "label": "Anchor, for the link from the stars", "default": "anmeldelser" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "count_label", "label": "Before the number of reviews", "default": "Baseret på" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "verdict_high", "label": "Word at 4.3 and above", "default": "Fremragende" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "verdict_mid", "label": "Word from 3.5 to 4.2", "default": "Godt" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "verdict_low", "label": "Word below 3.5", "default": "Middel" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "rated_label", "label": "Before the score", "default": "Bedømt" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "based_label", "label": "Between the score and the count", "default": "ud fra" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "reviews_word", "label": "After the count", "default": "anmeldelser" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "star_word", "label": "Word next to each bar", "default": "stjerner" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "verified_label", "label": "Verified buyer label", "default": "Verificeret køb" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_text", "label": "Text when there are no reviews yet", "default": "Der er endnu ingen anmeldelser af denne vare." },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "show_distribution", "label": "Show the bar chart", "default": true },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Layout" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "columns", "label": "Columns", "default": 3, "min": 1, "max": 4, "step": 1 },
    { "type": "range", "id": "desktop_initial", "label": "Reviews before the Load more button (computer)", "default": 3, "min": 2, "max": 12, "step": 1, "info": "Each click shows this many more. On phones all reviews are in a swipeable row." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "more_label", "label": "Load more button", "default": "Vis flere anmeldelser" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "title_size", "label": "Heading size", "default": 19, "min": 14, "max": 34, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
    { "type": "range", "id": "title_size_mobile", "label": "Heading size (mobile)", "default": 17, "min": 12, "max": 28, "step": 1, "unit": "px" },
